msgid ""
":class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.BaseUserManager` provides the following "
"utility methods:"
msgstr ""
":class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.BaseUserManager` tillhandahåller "
"följande verktygsmetoder:"

msgid ""
"Normalizes email addresses by lowercasing the domain portion of the email "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Normaliserar e-postadresser genom att skriva domändelen av e-postadressen "
"med liten bokstav."

msgid "*Asynchronous version*: ``aget_by_natural_key()``"
msgstr "*Asynkron version*: ``aget_by_natural_key()``"

msgid ""
"Retrieves a user instance using the contents of the field nominated by "
