"Medan :ref:`custom permissions <custom-permissions>` kan definieras i en "
"modells ``Meta``-klass, kan du också skapa behörigheter direkt. Du kan till "
"exempel skapa behörigheten ``can_publish`` för en ``BlogPost``-modell i "
"``myapp``::"

msgid ""
"The permission can then be assigned to "
"a :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User` via its ``user_permissions`` "
"attribute or to a :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.Group` via its "
"``permissions`` attribute."
msgstr ""
"Behörigheten kan sedan tilldelas "
"en :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.User` via dess attribut "
"``user_permissions`` eller till "
"en :class:`~django.contrib.auth.models.Group` via dess attribut "
"``permissions``."

msgid "Proxy models need their own content type"
msgstr "Proxy-modeller behöver sin egen innehållstyp"

msgid ""
"If you want to create :ref:`permissions for a proxy model <proxy-models-"
"permissions-topic>`, pass ``for_concrete_model=False`` "
"to :meth:`.ContentTypeManager.get_for_model` to get the appropriate "
