"författaren::"

msgid ""
"The generic ``DetailView`` class wouldn't know anything about this field, "
"but once again we could write a custom view to keep that field updated."
msgstr ""
"Den generiska klassen ``DetailView`` vet ingenting om det här fältet, men "
"återigen kan vi skriva en anpassad vy för att hålla fältet uppdaterat."

msgid ""
"First, we'd need to add an author detail bit in the URLconf to point to a "
