msgid "Model forms"
msgstr "Modellformer"

msgid ""
"Generic views really shine when working with models. These generic views "
"will automatically create a :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm`, so long as "
"they can work out which model class to use:"
msgstr ""
"Generiska vyer kommer verkligen till sin rätt när du arbetar med modeller. "
"Dessa generiska vyer skapar automatiskt "
"ett :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm`, så länge de kan avgöra vilken "
"modellklass som ska användas:"

msgid ""
"If the :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.ModelFormMixin.model` attribute is "
"given, that model class will be used."
msgstr ""
"Om attributet :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.ModelFormMixin.model` anges "
"kommer den modellklassen att användas."

msgid ""
"If :meth:`~django.views.generic.detail.SingleObjectMixin.get_object` returns "
"an object, the class of that object will be used."
msgstr ""
"Om :meth:`~django.views.generic.detail.SingleObjectMixin.get_object` "
"returnerar ett objekt används objektets klass."

msgid ""
"If a :attr:`~django.views.generic.detail.SingleObjectMixin.queryset` is "
"given, the model for that queryset will be used."
msgstr ""
"Om en :attr:`~django.views.generic.detail.SingleObjectMixin.queryset` anges, "
"kommer modellen för den queryset att användas."

msgid ""
"Model form views provide "
"a :meth:`~django.views.generic.edit.ModelFormMixin.form_valid` "
