"you have any special requirements; see below for examples."
msgstr ""
"Modellformulärvyer tillhandahåller en implementation "
"av :meth:`~django.views.generic.edit.ModelFormMixin.form_valid` som sparar "
"modellen automatiskt. Du kan åsidosätta den om du har särskilda krav; se "
"exemplen nedan."

msgid ""
"You don't even need to provide a ``success_url`` "
"for :class:`~django.views.generic.edit.CreateView` "
"or :class:`~django.views.generic.edit.UpdateView` - they will "
"use :meth:`~django.db.models.Model.get_absolute_url` on the model object if "
"available."
msgstr ""
"Du behöver inte ens ange en ``success_url`` "
"för :class:`~django.views.generic.edit.CreateView` "
"eller :class:`~django.views.generic.edit.UpdateView` – de "
"använder :meth:`~django.db.models.Model.get_absolute_url` på modellobjektet "
"om den finns."

msgid ""
"If you want to use a custom :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm` (for instance "
"to add extra validation), "
"set :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.form_class` on your view."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill använda en anpassad :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm` (t.ex. för "
"att lägga till extra validering), "
"ange :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.form_class` på din vy."

msgid ""
"When specifying a custom form class, you must still specify the model, even "
"though the :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.form_class` may be "
"a :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm`."
msgstr ""
"När du anger en anpassad formulärklass måste du fortfarande ange modellen, "
"även om :attr:`~django.views.generic.edit.FormMixin.form_class` kan vara "
"en :class:`~django.forms.ModelForm`."

msgid ""
"First we need to add :meth:`~django.db.models.Model.get_absolute_url` to our "
