msgid "Fetch modes"
msgstr "Hämtningslägen"

msgid ""
"When accessing model fields that were not loaded as part of the original "
"query, Django will fetch that field's data from the database. You can "
"customize the behavior of this fetching with a **fetch mode**, making it "
"more efficient or even blocking it."
