"to require each attribute to coincide in the same related object. We might "
"seek blogs that have an entry from 2008 with *“Lennon”* in its headline, or "
"we might seek blogs that merely have any entry from 2008 as well as some "
"newer or older entry with *“Lennon”* in its headline."
