"definierar :func:`~django.forms.formsets.formset_factory` ett extra "
"formulär; följande exempel kommer att skapa en formset-klass för att visa "
"två tomma formulär:"

msgid ""
"Formsets can be iterated and indexed, accessing forms in the order they were "
"created. You can reorder the forms by overriding the "
"default :meth:`~object.__iter__` and :meth:`~object.__getitem__` methods if "
